      <Id Type="MyObjectBuilder_PrefabDefinition" Subtype="Prefab_Nexus_VI-AS" />
        <DisplayName>Nexus VI-AS</DisplayName>
        <Description>Introducing the Nexus VI-AS, the ultimate carrier designed for your Stratos VI-X and Aerion VI-X ships. This colossal vessel offers unparalleled transport, protection, and support for your fleet. With its powerful engines, spacious cargo bay, and state-of-the-art bridge, the Nexus VI-AS is the perfect companion for your space adventures. Experience the future of space exploration with Volsung Industries.</Description>
